            <title>[LU-21114] sanity-quota test_82: mkdir EIO right after test_81 MDS1 restart (MDT0000 recovery/eviction)</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21114</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-quota test_82 failed on ZFS DNE (review-dne-zfs-part-4, el10.1) right after test_81 restarted MDS1:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;mkdir: cannot create directory '/mnt/lustre/d82.sanity-quota.parent': Input/output error&lt;br/&gt;
sanity-quota test_82: FAIL: failed to chown on /mnt/lustre/d82.sanity-quota.parent&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failed test set: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c3d4aa65-43cd-4ce2-acbb-54cf1b19fd2b" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c3d4aa65-43cd-4ce2-acbb-54cf1b19fd2b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Subtest: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/ab2b658b-073a-4a29-a6a0-3fd77e45560b" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/ab2b658b-073a-4a29-a6a0-3fd77e45560b&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_81 ("Race qmt_start_pool_recalc with qmt_pool_free") sets fail_loc=0x80000A07, then does "stop mds1 -f", "start mds1", and "clients_up || true", so it ends without waiting for MDT0000 recovery. test_82 started about 50s later. MDS dmesg (onyx-141vm12, which hosts MDT0000 and MDT0002):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;25677&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; umount -d -f /mnt/lustre-mds1&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;25685&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; lustre-MDT0000: not available for connect (no target)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;25689&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; MGC connection to MGS lost; lustre-MDT0000: recovery window 60-180&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;25694..25750&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; lustre-MDT0000-osp-MDT0002: This client was evicted by lustre-MDT0000&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;25740..25750&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; mds_statfs, fld_query, out_update to MDT0000 failed rc = -107; osp_attr_get rc = -5&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;25750&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; test_82 FAIL&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So the mkdir hit MDT0000 while the MDT0002 to MDT0000 OSP connection was being evicted and the MDT was still recovering, and returned EIO. test_81 passes in 2709 of 2709 review-dne-zfs-part-4 runs over 30 days and test_82 had no failure with this error in 730 days, so this is a rare race. Possible fix: have test_81 wait for MDT recovery (wait_recovery_complete mds1) after the restart, or have test_82 wait for it before the first mkdir.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Not caused by &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20517" title="sanity-quota test_1k: user write success, but expect EDQUOT (on ZFS)" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20517"&gt;LU-20517&lt;/a&gt; (change 69617), which touches only OST write quota accounting and test_1_check_write.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-69617-ps8-df7e2c4abf69 on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/69617" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/69617&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
